{title: 275 Humilde oración}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: Ademir Rodrigues (1954-; y; Amauri Barbosa (1962-; Vers. esp .. Carlos A. Steger (1953-}
{composer: Ademir Rodrigues (1954-; y; Amauri Barbosa (1962-}

{sov}
[F]En humilde ora[C]ción [F]quiero dedicar, Señor,
[Bb][C][F][G][C]mi indigno corazón por completo a ti.

[F]Hazme puro, san[Bb]to y [C]fiel, [F]quiero obedecer tu Ley.
[Bb][C][Am][Dm7][Gm7][C][F]Dame amor, bondad y fe, da -me tu poder.
{eov}
